---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Celestara Eterna | Beranda">
  <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 py-12 w-full">
    <section class="border border-ce-bronze/30 rounded-sm p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16 relative bg-ce-cream">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 border-b border-r border-ce-bronze/30 px-3 py-1 bg-ce-paper rounded-br-sm">
        <span class="font-mono text-ce-bronze text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase">IDX-01 / Hero</span>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mt-6">
        <h1 class="font-fraunces text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-ce-navy leading-tight mb-6">
          Arsitektur Digital Presisi untuk Eksekusi Terukur.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-ce-ink/90 leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl text-lg">
          Infrastruktur web fullstack dan spesialisasi sistem backend dengan metrik performa tinggi. Dibangun berdasarkan dua tahun rekayasa perangkat lunak tanpa kompromi redundansi.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a href="/portofolio" class="border border-ce-navy bg-ce-navy text-ce-paper px-6 py-3 text-center font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-ce-gold hover:border-ce-gold transition-colors duration-200">
            Lihat Portofolio
          </a>
          <a href="/layanan" class="border border-ce-bronze/50 text-ce-navy px-6 py-3 text-center font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:border-ce-navy transition-colors duration-200">
            Spesifikasi Layanan
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>